          "id": "AC-001",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "chain-model",
          "text": "定义 QA 层置信度传递模型：每层置信度 = 自身覆盖 ∩ 下层覆盖传递；链方向 unit→...→browser_e2e（**Must**，UD-001）",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260702T064422Z-55c5",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260702T144429722786",
